OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 MAR
OL,4,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,5,     GIggy serves up a sonic cocktail
OL,6,     Gto soundtrack your Sunday
OL,7,     Gafternoon. This week, he's got
OL,8,     GTyler, The Creator, Jenny Hval,
OL,9,     GJoe Tex, Fiona Apple and Brian
OL,10,     GEno in his record bag.
OL,11,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,12,     GWith a borderless spectrum of
OL,13,     Gmusic, new experiments in
OL,14,     GStorytelling and sound.
OL,15,G2000FStuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,16,     GStuart celebrates St David's Day
OL,17,     Gwith a Freak Zone Welsh special.
OL,18,     GExpect appearances from everyone
OL,19,     Gfrom Richard Burton to Young
OL,20,     GMarble Giants.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
